              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magulu ambiri a anthu anachokera ku Galileya, Dekapoli, Yerusalemu, Yudeya ndi ku madera a kutsidya la mtsinje wa Yorodani namutsata Iye.",
